{
 "title": "4K EQ",
 "children": [
  {
   "title": "Overview",
   "lines": [
    "British console EQ",
    "for the master bus.",
    "Four calibrated",
    "bands, stepped high",
    "and low-pass",
    "filters, Brown and",
    "Black voicings.",
    "",
    "DSP is 4K EQ 2 by",
    "Dusk Audio."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Main",
   "lines": [
    "Type: Brown is the",
    "E-series -",
    "transformers,",
    "constant-Q mids.",
    "Black is G-series:",
    "transformerless,",
    "proportional-Q.",
    "",
    "Ovrsmp 2x default.",
    "1x saves CPU and is",
    "clean in Brown.",
    "",
    "In drives the",
    "console's own",
    "nonlinearity.",
    "Out trims output.",
    "",
    "A.Gain offsets the",
    "level your curve",
    "adds. Off by",
    "default - it costs",
    "low end."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "LF",
   "lines": [
    "Gain +/-15 dB.",
    "Frq 30-450 Hz.",
    "Bell switches shelf",
    "to bell.",
    "",
    "HPF is the stepped",
    "console filter. Its",
    "bottom position is",
    "OUT, like the dial",
    "it comes from - turn",
    "it up and the",
    "filter comes in.",
    "There is no",
    "separate switch."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "LMF",
   "lines": [
    "Gain +/-15 dB.",
    "Frq 200 Hz-2.5 kHz.",
    "Q 0.5-3.0, always a",
    "bell.",
    "",
    "Ranges overlap the",
    "bands either side",
    "on purpose - they",
    "are the console's",
    "own dials."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "HMF",
   "lines": [
    "Gain +/-15 dB.",
    "Frq 600 Hz-7 kHz.",
    "Q 0.5-3.0, always a",
    "bell.",
    "",
    "Brown holds Q",
    "constant with gain.",
    "Black widens it as",
    "you cut, narrows as",
    "you boost."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "HF",
   "lines": [
    "Gain +/-15 dB.",
    "Frq 1.5-16 kHz.",
    "Bell switches shelf",
    "to bell.",
    "",
    "LPF is the stepped",
    "console filter, OUT",
    "at the top of its",
    "travel.",
    "",
    "The FX bus is",
    "16-bit, so a hard",
    "boost clips at the",
    "output, not in the",
    "EQ. Pull Out down",
    "to match."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Preset",
   "lines": [
    "INIT restores flat,",
    "then 14 factory",
    "programs from the",
    "plugin.",
    "",
    "Recall sets bands,",
    "filters and voicing.",
    "It leaves Bypass and",
    "Ovrsmp alone - those",
    "are yours, not the",
    "program's."
   ]
  }
 ]
}
